1
00:00:08,773 --> 00:00:11,973
You did say under the
chin, right, Polnareff?

2
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:13,290
What the hell?!

3
00:00:13,373 --> 00:00:15,413
Remember me, you fool?

4
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:17,913
I'm the Anubistan you fought earlier!

5
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:25,613
Matt, what do I do now? Goodbye!

6
00:00:26,033 --> 00:00:28,092
I'm gonna shave your jaw clean off!

7
00:00:33,953 --> 00:00:35,659
Who the hell are you, really?

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:38,387
And what have you done with the barber?

9
00:00:43,153 --> 00:00:45,113
Wait, could it possibly be that?

10
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,215
The sword is actually the stand?

11
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:49,392
Could it be controlling the barber?

12
00:00:49,793 --> 00:00:53,893
So the guy at Khan Ombo wasn't
a real stand user? Hold on!

13
00:00:58,993 --> 00:01:00,993
But in the end, it doesn't matter.

14
00:01:01,173 --> 00:01:03,526
I'm still way out of your league, buddy.

15
00:01:09,513 --> 00:01:10,343
What?

16
00:01:10,426 --> 00:01:12,213
How are you so strong?

17
00:01:12,553 --> 00:01:13,490
If you must know,

18
00:01:13,573 --> 00:01:17,550
I took the liberty of learning
chariots' moves during our last fight.

19
00:01:17,633 --> 00:01:20,045
I won't lose twice to the same adversary.

20
00:01:20,393 --> 00:01:21,873
Do you understand me?

21
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:30,213
To you, in a fire,

22
00:01:31,413 --> 00:01:33,150
I will face the love of my eyes.

23
00:01:33,233 --> 00:01:34,690
I will face you again.

24
00:01:34,773 --> 00:01:40,433
To you, in aаны, I will face
you again? To you, in a moment.

25
00:01:44,233 --> 00:01:47,653
The end of the dark, the end of the dark,

26
00:01:50,673 --> 00:01:54,430
A real sombra, the end of the dark, The
angel of the devil That's what I know of,

27
00:01:54,513 --> 00:01:57,073
I will face you again

28
00:02:36,299 --> 00:02:37,129
END OF THE WORLD

29
00:02:56,173 --> 00:03:02,093
that's it you can do it yeah come on you
can't give up now you've almost got it

30
00:03:13,673 --> 00:03:16,993
polnareff and jotaro they
should have returned by now

31
00:03:23,313 --> 00:03:24,690
Polareff, what's going on?

32
00:03:24,773 --> 00:03:26,302
The Barber's a stand user?

33
00:03:26,753 --> 00:03:28,173
Stay back, Jotaro!

34
00:03:29,373 --> 00:03:31,173
The sword is the stand!

35
00:03:32,213 --> 00:03:33,043
Trust me,

36
00:03:33,133 --> 00:03:37,330
it's too dangerous to try using Star
Platinum's bare fist against this blade!

37
00:03:37,413 --> 00:03:39,790
The sword's sharp enough
to slice through them!

38
00:03:39,873 --> 00:03:42,991
This Barber isn't the stand
user, he's just a puppet!

39
00:03:44,093 --> 00:03:46,152
And that's not even the worst part!

40
00:03:46,593 --> 00:03:49,240
The stand's even stronger
than it was before!

41
00:03:51,193 --> 00:03:52,023
Bastard!

42
00:03:52,533 --> 00:03:53,493
Whoa there!

43
00:03:58,253 --> 00:03:59,713
Too much for you?

44
00:04:01,773 --> 00:04:05,650
I suppose I should be grateful you've
shown me the limits of your defense.

45
00:04:05,733 --> 00:04:06,813
Most kind of you.

46
00:04:08,433 --> 00:04:12,668
Now then, let's see if you have what
it takes to survive my next attack.

47
00:04:13,513 --> 00:04:15,773
Shall we, Polnareff? Time.

48
00:04:20,673 --> 00:04:21,533
Polareff!

49
00:04:26,433 --> 00:04:28,313
His powers keep increasing!

50
00:04:28,573 --> 00:04:29,733
With every strike!

51
00:04:30,113 --> 00:04:32,213
I can't keep parrying forever!

52
00:04:32,693 --> 00:04:34,693
Sooner or later he's gonna get me!

53
00:04:38,893 --> 00:04:39,753
Now!

54
00:04:40,893 --> 00:04:42,313
Take this!

55
00:04:44,813 --> 00:04:46,053
How in the...

56
00:04:47,873 --> 00:04:52,293
In case you haven't realized the
obvious, I know all your moves.

57
00:04:52,573 --> 00:04:55,093
It doesn't matter who my wielder is,

58
00:04:55,233 --> 00:04:58,233
as long as I've done battle
with you at least once.

59
00:04:58,473 --> 00:04:59,913
I never ever,

60
00:05:09,953 --> 00:05:12,393
I'm not gonna win this without my rapier.

61
00:05:13,173 --> 00:05:14,003
Oh, no!

62
00:05:14,353 --> 00:05:15,793
Jotaro, help me out here!

63
00:05:16,613 --> 00:05:17,653
Star Platinum.

64
00:05:26,993 --> 00:05:28,490
Think that finished him off?

65
00:05:28,573 --> 00:05:29,403
No.

66
00:05:29,486 --> 00:05:30,506
That punch was shallow.

67
00:05:30,673 --> 00:05:33,497
Even though it took just
about everything I had.

68
00:05:34,213 --> 00:05:35,043
Shit.

69
00:05:35,233 --> 00:05:36,453
This guy's strong.

70
00:05:37,153 --> 00:05:41,010
It's been quite a while now since
we've seen a stand like this one.

71
00:05:41,093 --> 00:05:42,681
It only relies on strength.

72
00:05:45,433 --> 00:05:47,613
Not bad, Star Platinum.

73
00:05:47,873 --> 00:05:49,932
The rumors of your speed were true.

74
00:05:50,393 --> 00:05:55,013
But now that I've seen it,
I can easily defeat it.

75
00:06:00,653 --> 00:06:02,853
Hey, Khan, what's wrong with you?

76
00:06:03,133 --> 00:06:04,033
Stay back!

77
00:06:04,333 --> 00:06:05,690
Your friend is being controlled.

78
00:06:05,773 --> 00:06:09,773
If you don't want to get sliced to
ribbons, go back inside and hide!

79
00:06:13,433 --> 00:06:15,257
We're in major trouble, Jotaro.

80
00:06:15,533 --> 00:06:18,573
The more we fight this
stand, the faster it gets.

81
00:06:20,373 --> 00:06:24,270
And its next attack will probably
be its fastest and strongest yet.

82
00:06:24,353 --> 00:06:28,706
We have to be ready for whatever this
glorified butter knife throws at us!

83
00:06:32,453 --> 00:06:33,413
Move, Polareff!

84
00:06:33,613 --> 00:06:35,378
I'm the one it's really after!

85
00:06:35,773 --> 00:06:38,033
Get out of there, Jotaro! Die!

86
00:06:41,893 --> 00:06:42,723
What?

87
00:06:42,813 --> 00:06:44,113
With his bare hands?

88
00:06:49,393 --> 00:06:50,223
Amazing!

89
00:06:50,453 --> 00:06:52,629
For him to take that great of a risk!

90
00:06:53,733 --> 00:06:56,093
Now it's become abundantly clear.

91
00:06:56,373 --> 00:07:00,667
The true source of Star Platinum's
strength isn't its speed or precision.

92
00:07:00,793 --> 00:07:04,675
It's Jotaro's nerves of steel and
ability to make quick decisions.

93
00:07:06,333 --> 00:07:07,793
Yes, now I know it.

94
00:07:07,973 --> 00:07:08,853
For sure.

95
00:07:20,533 --> 00:07:21,453
Is he dead?

96
00:07:23,513 --> 00:07:24,984
Hold on a second, Jotaro.

97
00:07:25,093 --> 00:07:26,387
He's just knocked out!

98
00:07:27,133 --> 00:07:29,486
Whatever you do, don't touch that sword.

99
00:07:29,653 --> 00:07:33,210
You snapped it in half, but the stand's
powers might still be lingering.

100
00:07:33,293 --> 00:07:36,693
It controls anyone who
touches it while unsheathed.

101
00:07:37,053 --> 00:07:40,465
Let's get the blade back inside
without touching the hilt.

102
00:07:50,153 --> 00:07:51,113
Now what?

103
00:07:51,333 --> 00:07:53,490
If someone draws it again, we're done for.

104
00:07:53,573 --> 00:07:56,430
This damn thing has already
learned all of our abilities.

105
00:07:56,513 --> 00:07:59,395
I don't think we're gonna
get any second chances.

106
00:08:00,433 --> 00:08:04,030
Why not toss it into the river to
rust at the bottom of the Nile?

107
00:08:04,113 --> 00:08:05,233
The Nile, huh?

108
00:08:05,473 --> 00:08:07,470
That sounds like a great plan to me.

109
00:08:07,553 --> 00:08:08,383
Hold it!

110
00:08:08,466 --> 00:08:09,296
This is the police!

111
00:08:09,379 --> 00:08:10,570
This is perfect timing.

112
00:08:10,653 --> 00:08:11,890
This guy needs a hospital.

113
00:08:11,973 --> 00:08:14,650
I have multiple reports of
a brawl at a barber shop!

114
00:08:14,733 --> 00:08:16,250
What are you doing with that sword?

115
00:08:16,333 --> 00:08:17,163
Huh?

116
00:08:17,693 --> 00:08:19,410
Hand this weapon over immediately!

117
00:08:19,493 --> 00:08:20,846
Hey, stop it, would ya?

118
00:08:21,473 --> 00:08:22,653
Don't pull it out!

119
00:08:33,793 --> 00:08:34,623
Polnareff!

120
00:08:35,973 --> 00:08:37,193
Oh, damn it.

121
00:08:38,973 --> 00:08:40,073
His eyes.

122
00:08:40,453 --> 00:08:41,453
That stare.

123
00:08:43,333 --> 00:08:46,333
Polnareff is being controlled
by the sword's spell.

124
00:08:47,033 --> 00:08:48,593
Hey! You there!

125
00:08:48,793 --> 00:08:49,933
You drew the sword!

126
00:08:51,893 --> 00:08:54,093
I drew the sword, did I?

127
00:08:55,153 --> 00:08:58,790
Officer, you should really be more
careful with your accusations.

128
00:08:58,873 --> 00:09:01,520
since you call yourself
a servant of the law.

129
00:09:01,813 --> 00:09:03,793
Take it easy! What are you doing?

130
00:09:04,133 --> 00:09:07,545
I'm simply attacking the culprit
who uncheateth the sword!

131
00:09:10,253 --> 00:09:13,077
I don't know who you are
or where you're hiding,

132
00:09:13,433 --> 00:09:17,021
but I think it's safe to say
Polnareff is under your control.

133
00:09:17,213 --> 00:09:21,331
Come to think of it, I've never had
to fight against Polnareff before.

134
00:09:22,373 --> 00:09:25,491
And I can't pull punches
with Chariot as an opponent.

135
00:09:26,793 --> 00:09:28,653
If I'm not smart about this...

136
00:09:28,873 --> 00:09:30,833
I could end up killing Polnareff.

137
00:09:33,433 --> 00:09:35,133
As I said before,

138
00:09:35,573 --> 00:09:40,090
at this point I've already witnessed Star
Platinum's entire repertoire of moves.

139
00:09:40,173 --> 00:09:46,633
And if I've done battle with you once
before, then I will never lose again!

140
00:09:53,133 --> 00:09:54,313
Okay, now.

141
00:10:02,973 --> 00:10:04,093
His speed...

142
00:10:04,873 --> 00:10:05,814
It's incredible!

143
00:10:06,493 --> 00:10:08,833
He's getting fast enough to outpace me!

144
00:10:09,273 --> 00:10:11,793
I have to find a way to stop that sword!

145
00:10:13,693 --> 00:10:14,953
I'll catch it again!

146
00:10:18,053 --> 00:10:19,053
He's sped up!

147
00:10:19,173 --> 00:10:21,713
This time, I'll take your hand!

148
00:10:33,033 --> 00:10:35,268
This speed and power are overwhelming.

149
00:10:36,273 --> 00:10:39,753
Without a doubt, this is the
fastest stand I've ever faced.

150
00:10:40,513 --> 00:10:43,042
At the rate I'm going,
this won't end well.

151
00:10:44,033 --> 00:10:48,373
I have to fight Polnareff with
everything I've got, or I'm dead.

152
00:10:52,673 --> 00:10:56,790
So, you headbutted the sword after you
realized you couldn't catch my blade.

153
00:10:56,873 --> 00:11:02,490
Honestly I didn't think you were capable
of something like that I almost had you!

154
00:11:02,573 --> 00:11:06,970
But now I've acquired that

155
00:11:07,053 --> 00:11:13,550
skill as well Jotaro I can tell

156
00:11:13,633 --> 00:11:16,290
that you're thinking The only
way to survive is to kill

157
00:11:16,373 --> 00:11:21,810
your friend Polnareff even if
you wanted to It's naive to

158
00:11:21,893 --> 00:11:26,570
think it'd be that easy take
a close look Jotaro what am I?

159
00:11:26,653 --> 00:11:30,124
about to show you will put an
end to this once and for all.

160
00:11:30,973 --> 00:11:37,133
So let's see if you can beat this, Totoro!

161
00:11:38,373 --> 00:11:41,333
Feast your eyes on the
Silver Chariot and Anubis!

162
00:11:41,873 --> 00:11:43,333
Two-Sword Technique!

163
00:12:26,213 --> 00:12:27,193
Damn it.

164
00:12:27,573 --> 00:12:31,173
This extra sword, coupled
with this accelerating speed,

165
00:12:31,673 --> 00:12:33,833
even Star Platinum won't last long.

166
00:12:35,193 --> 00:12:36,273
What's the matter?

167
00:12:36,433 --> 00:12:38,430
Are you feeling a little tired, Jojaro?

168
00:12:38,513 --> 00:12:39,343
No!

169
00:12:41,093 --> 00:12:43,034
I'll stop him before he kills me.

170
00:12:43,633 --> 00:12:44,463
Starfinger!

171
00:12:50,673 --> 00:12:53,213
My right arm is as light as a feather now.

172
00:12:54,693 --> 00:12:57,046
Interesting, I guess that was an option.

173
00:12:58,093 --> 00:12:59,950
Didn't see that coming, did you?

174
00:13:00,033 --> 00:13:02,033
Round two, armor release!

175
00:13:07,913 --> 00:13:09,093
You fool,

176
00:13:09,373 --> 00:13:11,750
your ridiculous aura aura is no match for

177
00:13:11,833 --> 00:13:14,713
two swords wielded by
two master swordsmen.

178
00:13:22,773 --> 00:13:24,953
Your stomach is wide open!

179
00:13:26,573 --> 00:13:28,353
I've got you now!

180
00:13:31,413 --> 00:13:33,410
I did it! I win!

181
00:13:33,493 --> 00:13:36,713
Master Dio, I've exterminated Jotaro!

182
00:13:37,113 --> 00:13:39,893
I, Anubis, have finally put him down!

183
00:13:40,633 --> 00:13:42,153
Victory is mine!

184
00:13:50,233 --> 00:13:51,553
Just forget it!

185
00:13:51,713 --> 00:13:54,130
You're not going to be able
to pull out that blade!

186
00:13:54,213 --> 00:13:55,154
Give up already!

187
00:13:55,433 --> 00:13:59,830
I'm not sure your tiny brain has realized
it, but I've surpassed Star Platinum!

188
00:13:59,913 --> 00:14:01,753
And now, the final thrust!

189
00:14:04,193 --> 00:14:05,023
The...

190
00:14:05,106 --> 00:14:05,936
final thrust?

191
00:14:06,233 --> 00:14:07,613
Yes, precisely!

192
00:14:08,153 --> 00:14:11,388
Once I slice open your bowels,
Master Dio will rejoice!

193
00:14:11,773 --> 00:14:13,113
Please, stop this.

194
00:14:13,293 --> 00:14:15,293
Don't drive the blade any further.

195
00:14:15,473 --> 00:14:16,303
It...

196
00:14:16,386 --> 00:14:17,253
it'll be murder.

197
00:14:17,793 --> 00:14:18,653
Nice try!

198
00:14:18,953 --> 00:14:21,093
But you won't get any mercy from me!

199
00:14:21,313 --> 00:14:23,333
I can't wait to spill your guts!

200
00:14:37,313 --> 00:14:38,790
What the devil?!

201
00:14:38,873 --> 00:14:40,133
You're breaking me!

202
00:14:40,293 --> 00:14:41,633
I have to fall free!

203
00:14:42,693 --> 00:14:44,193
No! Stop!

204
00:14:47,673 --> 00:14:51,908
Maybe I'm wrong, but weren't you
saying something about slicing me open?

205
00:15:00,393 --> 00:15:02,313
I told you it'd be murder.

206
00:15:02,853 --> 00:15:06,033
But the murder I was talking
about was yours, friend.

207
00:15:06,833 --> 00:15:10,539
You're a pretty easy target when
the sword isn't moving around.

208
00:15:14,413 --> 00:15:16,633
Dammit, what a pain in the ass.

209
00:15:17,153 --> 00:15:19,624
This was the toughest opponent I've faced.

210
00:15:19,913 --> 00:15:22,730
At last, the attack took everything
I had in me and then some.

211
00:15:22,813 --> 00:15:23,643
Luckily,

212
00:15:23,726 --> 00:15:25,250
it was just enough to
defeat him before he could

213
00:15:25,333 --> 00:15:27,980
learn it like he did
the rest of our attacks.

214
00:15:28,373 --> 00:15:29,333
This is new.

215
00:15:29,693 --> 00:15:31,473
I've never been so exhausted.

216
00:15:34,393 --> 00:15:37,433
I have to find Avdol and the old man.

217
00:15:42,373 --> 00:15:44,255
What in the world just happened?

218
00:15:48,153 --> 00:15:52,094
The sword didn't possess me like
it did all the other guys, did it?

219
00:15:52,213 --> 00:15:53,473
Yeah, it did.

220
00:15:53,773 --> 00:15:56,133
But it's over now. Forgive me.

221
00:15:57,713 --> 00:16:00,073
Just get the old man and Avdol.

222
00:16:00,353 --> 00:16:01,873
I'm too tired to walk.

223
00:16:02,913 --> 00:16:03,753
Huh?

224
00:16:06,133 --> 00:16:08,253
Wow, it's so shiny.

225
00:16:22,373 --> 00:16:24,913
Now, I've learned that trick.

226
00:16:25,213 --> 00:16:30,310
My original stand user was the
swordsmith who forged me 500 years ago.

227
00:16:30,393 --> 00:16:36,273
He may have perished centuries ago, but
I survive as a stand with no master.

228
00:16:36,813 --> 00:16:40,793
Master Tio liberated me from the
gloomy shadows of a dusty museum.

229
00:16:42,713 --> 00:16:49,373
And speaking of Master Tio, his stand,
the world, is far more powerful than I.

230
00:16:49,853 --> 00:16:52,713
That's why I pledged my undying loyalty.

231
00:16:55,153 --> 00:17:01,153
Jotaro, I swear on my
life, I will murder you!

232
00:17:01,973 --> 00:17:04,533
I know your strength, your speed.

233
00:17:04,713 --> 00:17:07,948
You won't see it coming until
it's too late to stop it!

234
00:17:08,153 --> 00:17:09,953
I'll stab you in the back!

235
00:17:13,153 --> 00:17:15,553
Now die, Jotaro!

236
00:17:18,353 --> 00:17:19,733
What just happened?

237
00:17:20,673 --> 00:17:22,473
Son of a... I missed!

238
00:17:22,753 --> 00:17:24,293
I was tripped by a dog!

239
00:17:24,633 --> 00:17:26,973
Where the hell did that mutt come from?

240
00:17:27,513 --> 00:17:29,553
Hey, Iggy, what are you eating?

241
00:17:29,873 --> 00:17:30,833
Wait a second.

242
00:17:31,013 --> 00:17:32,813
Is that a nasty old sucker?

243
00:17:33,433 --> 00:17:36,813
Eating right off the ground
again, you filthy mutt.

244
00:17:40,553 --> 00:17:42,024
You've got to be kidding!

245
00:17:42,133 --> 00:17:43,309
It's the Nile River!

246
00:17:44,493 --> 00:17:46,393
No, this can't be happening!

247
00:17:46,753 --> 00:17:49,170
What did I do to deserve this cruel fate?

248
00:17:49,253 --> 00:17:53,093
If I fall into the river I'm
done for, I'll rust away!

249
00:17:53,813 --> 00:17:55,413
Somebody stop me!

250
00:17:59,273 --> 00:18:00,813
I'm heading for a wall!

251
00:18:01,053 --> 00:18:02,373
The wall will stop me!

252
00:18:02,893 --> 00:18:03,913
Lucky me!

253
00:18:04,873 --> 00:18:06,773
What the? Shit!

254
00:18:07,133 --> 00:18:09,430
I was so panicked about
falling into the water

255
00:18:09,513 --> 00:18:12,190
that I accidentally face
right through the wall!

256
00:18:12,273 --> 00:18:13,653
I'm gonna fall in!

257
00:18:17,093 --> 00:18:18,330
Yes, it's a ship!

258
00:18:18,413 --> 00:18:19,330
I'm saved.

